   116	### Technology Stack
   117	
   118	**Frontend**:
   119	- **Vue 3** with Composition API for reactive UI
   120	- **TypeScript** for type safety
   121	- **Pinia** for state management
   122	- **Three.js** for 3D visualization
   123	- **D3.js** for 2D geometric operations
