    66	  - **Problem**: `Line2DParallel.realize2D()` does not check for degenerate reference line direction. If the reference line is infeasible/degenerate, the parallel line silently inherits bad geometry instead of marking itself infeasible. Other realize2D methods have guards but coverage is incomplete.
    67	  - **Solution**: Audit all realize2D methods and add degenerate parent checks: zero-length direction vectors, coincident parent points, infeasible parent propagation. Add comprehensive tests.
    68	  - **Spec References**: FR-080, Phase 111 in data-model.md, tasks.md (T1858-T1862)
