===== specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/tasks.md =====
     1	# Tasks: Diedrico Dihedral Learning MVP
     2	
     3	**Input**: Design documents from `/specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/`  
     4	**Prerequisites**: plan.md, spec.md, data-model.md, contracts/, research.md, quickstart.md
     5	
     6	**Tests**: Per Diedrico Constitution (Principle VII: Pragmatic Testing), tests are expected where they add clear value: complex domain logic, commands/operations, and critical user journeys SHOULD have tests (unit/integration/E2E). Tests may be written before or after implementation depending on what is most effective.
     7	
     8	**Organization**: Tasks follow the 27 incremental phases from plan.md, organized to enable layer-by-layer development.
     9	
    10	**Constitution Compliance**: All tasks respect:
    11	- Layered Architecture (Principle I) - Domain → Application → Presentation → Data
    12	- Command Pattern (Principle II) - All user actions as commands
    13	- Frontend-First (Principle III) - Backend only for persistence
    14	- Technology Discipline (Principle IV) - Vue.js 3, TypeScript, Node.js, Vite, Vitest, Playwright
    15	
    16	## Format: `- [ ] [ID] [P?] Description`
    17	
    18	- **[P]**: Can run in parallel (different files, no dependencies)
    19	- Include exact file paths in descriptions
    20	
