    22	
    23	## Phase 1: Basic World Data Structures
    24	
    25	**Purpose**: Minimal data model foundation  
    26	**Reference**: [spec.md](./spec.md#conceptual-model-user-pov) - Conceptual Model, [data-model.md](./data-model.md) - World structure
    27	
    28	**Implementation Requirements**:
    29	- **Three.js Vector Types**: ALL coordinates MUST use Three.js types: `Vector3` for 2D (u, v, 1), `Vector4` for 3D (x, y, z, w). Arrays are NOT allowed for coordinates.
    30	- **Required IDs**: ALL geometric objects MUST have a required `id: string` field. IDs are assigned by World.generatePointId() before construction.
    31	- **World Container**: Must store all geometric elements in a single root entity per [data-model.md §World Entity](./data-model.md#world-entity). World contains: projection planes, 2D elements, 3D elements, and realization caches.
    32	- **Realization System**: Points store their DEFINITION (rule), realizations store COMPUTED coordinates. FreePoint2D stores position directly, IntersectionPoint2D stores element1Id/element2Id/index.
    33	- **Plane Intrinsic Coordinates**: ALL point coordinates MUST be stored in plane-local <u,v> coordinates, NOT canvas pixels per [data-model.md §Coordinate Systems](./data-model.md#coordinate-systems-and-transformations).
    34	- **No Implicit Logic**: Follow [spec.md §No Implicit Entities Rule](./spec.md#2d-elements-explicit-entities) - only create entities explicitly requested by user, no automatic inference.
    35	
    36	**⚠️ CRITICAL**: Read [data-model.md §Architecture Overview](./data-model.md#architecture-overview) and [plan.md §Key Implementation Decisions](./plan.md#key-implementation-decisions) to understand coordinate representation and realization system.
    37	
    38	- [X] T001 [P] Create World class in frontend/src/domain/world/World.ts with Map storage and generatePointId()
    39	- [X] T002 [P] Create Point2D base class, FreePoint2D, IntersectionPoint2D in frontend/src/domain/world/Point.ts using Vector3
    40	- [X] T003 [P] Create Point2DRealization and Point3DRealization classes using Vector3/Vector4
    41	- [X] T004 [P] Add realization caches to World: pointRealizations2D, pointRealizations3D (organized by type)
    42	- [X] T005 [P] Implement RealizationContext interface in World with getPoint2DRealization(), getPoint3DRealization()
    43	- [X] T006 [P] Implement realize() method in FreePoint2D (returns position) and IntersectionPoint2D (placeholder)
    44	- [X] T007 [P] Add point storage methods to World (addPoint expects id already set, removePoint, getPointById)
    45	- [X] T008 [P] Unit test for World class in frontend/tests/unit/domain/world.spec.ts
    46	- [X] T009 [P] Unit test for Point classes in frontend/tests/unit/domain/point.spec.ts
    47	
