    91	- **SVG Canvas**: Main workspace MUST use SVG element (not HTML5 Canvas) for geometric rendering per [ui-spec.md §Canvas Component](./ui-spec.md#canvas-component). SVG enables precise coordinate mapping and CSS styling.
    92	- **Responsive Layout**: Canvas must fill available space, sidebars collapsible per [ui-spec.md §Layout Behavior](./ui-spec.md#layout-behavior).
