   139	## Phase 4: Render Points
   140	
   141	**Purpose**: Display user-created points using Paper abstraction  
   142	**Reference**: [spec.md](./spec.md#2d-elements-explicit-entities) - 2D Elements (Points)
   143	
   144	**Implementation Requirements**:
   145	- **Point Representation**: Use [data-model.md §Point2D](./data-model.md#point2d) with Point2DRealization storing <u,v> coordinates.
   146	- **Paper Architecture**: Transform flow: Point2D → Point2DRealization (u,v) → PaperService (apply PlaneRealization2D) → Paper primitives (x,y) → SVGRenderer (apply viewport) → SVG
   147	- **Realization System**: Point coordinates cached in Point2DRealization. Plane transformations cached in ProjectionPlaneRealization2D.
   148	- **Visual States**: Free points = circles, derived points = squares per [spec.md §2D Elements](./spec.md#2d-elements-edited-in-projection-views). Apply hover/selection states from [ui-spec.md §Visual Feedback](./ui-spec.md#visual-feedback-hover-and-selection).
   149	- **Naming Convention**: Use subscript notation (a_H, b_V) per [spec.md §Naming Conventions](./spec.md#coordinate-system-monge-projection).
   150	
   151	**⚠️ CRITICAL**: Architecture now uses Rule → Realization → Paper → SVG pipeline. Points store rules, realizations cache computed values.
